# System Guardian

Monitoring, security, and infrastructure system for Coolify environments.

## Stack

- Next.js 16 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind, Shadcn UI
- API Routes + Cron endpoints, Drizzle ORM, PostgreSQL
- Deploy on Coolify (Linux); checks via SSH to monitored host

## Alert levels

- **INFO** – normal events
- **WARNING** – non-critical (SSL <30d, container restart)
- **CRITICAL** – immediate notify (RAID failure, backup missing, unknown root login, DB offline)

## Cron schedule

- `/api/cron/server` – every 15 min (modules 1–10)
- `/api/cron/security` – every 60 min (modules 11–16)
- `/api/cron/daily-report` – daily 09:00

Protect cron routes with `Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET}`.

## Check modules (16)

Server, RAID, Docker, Coolify, DB, SSL, Website, Ports, Backups, Logs, SSH keys, Users, Logins, Cron, Network, Scanner.

## Code layout

- `src/lib/checks/` – one file per module
- `src/lib/ssh/` – SSH client (prod) and mock (Windows dev)
- `src/db/schema/` – Drizzle tables
- `src/lib/alerts/` – dedup and persistence
- `src/lib/notifications/` – Telegram and email
